    <pageContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a58b29f0-29c6-47b8-b8ce-329b38fbed3c",
      "key": "6c85e157-df31-467a-924e-8a033b284bc8",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch2\u003EThe challenge\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe digital footprint for a luxury travel brand is critical, enabling travellers to search for details of each hotel, view beautiful pictures of each property, and make a reservation in a quick and frictionless way. The quality of a travel website makes a significant difference to the conversion rate for guest bookings.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESLH\u0027s existing website was somewhat misaligned with the SLH brand. It did not offer either the range of features or the effortless reservation experience that visitors expected. Subsequently, travellers were struggling to complete bookings, meaning that SLH and its community of hotels were missing out on potential revenue. The overall conversion rate was 0.4%, a figure that SLH wanted to raise.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIn 2021 the SLH team approached 3chillies intending to transform their website into a world-class booking experience that would properly reflect the quality and spirit of the SLH brand and its exceptional hotels, and ultimately raise the conversion rate.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EOur work\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAfter onboarding SLH from their existing digital supplier and carrying out a thorough site audit, we partnered with SLH on an ambitious and far-reaching programme of digital change intending to leapfrog the website and booking experience of SLH\u0027s competitors.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESince that time, we have worked on several improvements to the site including new content areas and seamless integrations with back-end travel and booking systems. Drawing on our technical expertise and knowledge, we ensured we delivered a smooth and high-performing site that puts the hotels and destinations centre stage and enables visitors to book with ease.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EThe results\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe result is a slick and stylish website which is powered by a completely new online booking engine. Travel Agents can also log in to the site via the Travel Trade Hub. We also built APIs for a future project to revamp SLH\u0027s mobile app so it could integrate with the SLH website.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAs a result of 3chillies work, 2023 turned out to be the most successful year for SLH.com to date. With more stock available, an uptick in bookings and a large increase in the number of agents using the Travel Trade Hub, the new website experience has helped to deliver an overall increase in departure revenue for SLH and its properties.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMost importantly, the conversion rate on the website has leapt from 0.4% to 1.2%, making a tangible difference to SLH.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EThe future\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe\u0027re proud to be continuing our partnership with SLH, improving the website through a series of smaller, iterative changes, and helping deliver a new mobile app to match the website experience.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
